{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkwQHrCvqK6yGaQiy4dW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'm probably going with Harel's track called \"כספי (שקלי)\", but I'm not signing anything until I've asked you or someone at the bank. Of everything on that page, it was the only line that looked like my deposits. It showed \"0%\" next to \"מניות\" and \"0%\" next to \"מט\"ח\", so as far as I could tell no shares and no foreign currency. Harel is a big name I know, and its line said \"כסף מנוהל 19.1 מיליארד ₪\". Next to \"3 שנים\" it showed \"4.25%\", and the column says \"תשואה שנתית ממוצעת\", so I think that's per year. Meitav's \"כספי (שקלי)\" showed a little more, \"4.41%\", but I trust Harel's name more. I'm not sure at all. It's a choice by elimination, not something I understand.\n\n**What I looked at, in order**\n- **Screen 1:** The button \"קופת גמל להשקעה 143\" was already lit, which is what I came for, so I stayed. There was a row of buttons I didn't understand (\"עוקב מדד S&P 500\", \"קיימות\", \"גמיש\") and I left them alone. I noticed \"אג\"ח ממשלות\", because government bonds I know are safe, but I didn't press it.\n- **Screens 2–6:** A long black table. Harel first, then Mor, Analyst and Meitav. In each line I read only the name on the right, the fee, and the share/foreign-currency numbers.\n- **Where I stopped:** After screen 6, when Meitav's list began, I was too tired. I never saw what comes further down.\n\n**What I skipped**\n- The little rings and the yellow and green dots. I didn't try to work out what they mean.\n- Every track with English letters or \"עוקב מדד\".\n- All the \"פחות מ־3 שנים\" lines.\n- The \"?\" signs.\n- \"מה זו קופת גמל להשקעה\". I should probably have pressed that one, but I didn't.\n\n**Words and marks I didn't understand**\n- \"מט\"ח\"\n- \"עוקב מדד\"\n- \"S&P 500\", which I read letter by letter\n- \"גמיש\", \"קיימות\", \"סחיר\"\n- \"כספי (שקלי)\": I guessed it means cash in shekels\n- \"123 מקורות / 123 מחושב\"\n- The number under each company, like \"8521\"\n- \"עוד לא דווח\" with an orange \"!\" next to it\n- \"חדש\"\n- How a track can have \"101%\" in shares\n- The purple dotted lines under the numbers\n- Whether \"0.57% מהחיסכון\" means they take that from my savings every year, and whether that's a lot\n\n**What bothered me, worst first**\n- **The colours:** A black screen with grey writing. The headings at the top of the columns are small and pale, so I couldn't really read them even with my glasses.\n- **Too many numbers:** Each line has about eight of them. It made me nervous and I kept losing my place in the middle of a line.\n- **No banks:** Not one bank on the page, only insurance companies. Of those, Harel is the only name I actually know.\n- **No comparison to a deposit:** Nothing tells me whether \"4.25%\" is more or less than what my deposit gives me. Nothing says whether this is safe or whether I could lose money.\n- **Unclear fees:** I couldn't tell whether \"0.57%\" is cheap or expensive. Some of Meitav's lines also had \"0.01%\" under \"מההפקדות\" and I didn't know what that was."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3744,"cache_read_input_tokens":11669,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3744},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1cf73810-1796-4df3-b2a6-934a2fda79cf","uuid":"425d41a7-ee00-45ea-b0c9-0f0599baefd4","timestamp":"2026-11-06T03:09:08.858Z","request_id":"req_011CgkwQHNBkhpuq6Z5d2dJv"}
